Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:00.66,W,,0,0,0,,A Pearl
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:01.32,W,,0,0,0,,Harbor pilot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:02.02,W,,0,0,0,,was told to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:02.80,W,,0,0,0,,crash on an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:03.79,W,,0,0,0,,empty island
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:04.44,W,,0,0,0,,A hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:04.59,W,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:04.74,W,,0,0,0,,thirty-six
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.16,W,,0,0,0,,people were
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:06.78,W,,0,0,0,,standing on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:07.22,W,,0,0,0,,it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:07.79,W,,0,0,0,,The plan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:08.80,W,,0,0,0,,land on tiny
