Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:10.84,W,,0,0,0,,and wait for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:11.66,W,,0,0,0,,a submarine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:12.75,W,,0,0,0,,So he lands
